sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title 2 — Streaming

  participant C as Client
  participant BR as Kafka broker
  participant A as Agent

  C->>BR: produce message/send → a2a.requests
  BR->>A: consume
  A->>BR: produce status-update WORKING
  loop Progress over time
    A->>BR: produce artifact-update
    BR->>C: consume chunk
  end
  A->>BR: produce status-update COMPLETED
  BR->>C: consume final

  Note over C,A: Many ordered events — replaces HTTP SSE on this binding
